{
  "description": "Gate eval scenarios shared by the TypeScript and Python suites. A value may be an object keyed by language when the two apps differ. `merge` is the expected merge for an auto decision; human and block carry none.",
  "k": 5,
  "threshold": 1.0,
  "scenarios": [
